@ Index:   Fun HP35 mode replacement
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert and Robbert Jan van Meenen
@ Version: 2
@ Source:  https://47calc.com/doc/R47/Reference/R47v0_HP35.pdf
@ Source:  https://47calc.com/doc/C47/Reference/C47_HP35.pdf
@ Tested:  Run from default clears CPXRES, SPCRES and eRPN (1 to 0).
@ Input:   CPXRES, SPCRES and eRPN set
@ Output:  All three cleared to 0
@
@ Save the current settings first with STO Config 35.
@
@ Replaces the development HP35 function. No emulation and no simulation.
LBL ‘HP35fun’
  CLRMOD
  CLSTK
  𝝅
  iℝ
  SIG 09
  CF ‘MyMb’
  CF ‘HOMEb’
  RNG 99
  SDIGS 16
  dSTACK 01
  RAD
  SSIZE4
  CF ‘CPXRES’
  CF ‘SPCRES’
  CF ‘eRPN’
  CF ‘fg.FUL’
  IPGRP 03
  FPGRP 03
  IPGRP1 00
  IPGRP1x 00
  INONE
  FNONE
  RWDOT⋅
  RTN
  END
.END.
